  "question": {
    "text": "Let \\(S\\) be the sample space of the random experiment of throwing simultaneously two unbiased dice and \\(E_k=\\{a, b) \\in\\) \\(S: a b=k\\}\\). If \\(p_k=P\\left(E_k\\right)\\), then the correct among the following is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "yOgGL",
      "text": "\\(p_1  < p_{10} < p_4\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "8Jf0S",
      "text": "\\(\\mathrm{p}_2  < \\mathrm{p}_8 < \\mathrm{p}_{14}\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "3n5vz",
      "text": "\\(\\mathrm{p}_4  < \\mathrm{p}_8 < \\mathrm{p}_{17}\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "6PDpa",
      "text": "\\(\\mathrm{p}_2  < \\mathrm{p}_{16} < \\mathrm{p}_5\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \\(E_1=\\{(1,1)\\}, \\quad E_4=\\{(2,2),(1,4),(4,1)\\} \\quad E_{10}=\\{(2,5),(5,2)\\}\\)\n\\(p_1=\\frac{1}{36}\\)\n\\(p_4=\\frac{3}{36}=\\frac{1}{12}\\),\n\\(p_{10}=\\frac{2}{36}=\\frac{1}{18}\\)",
